authored by long-departed coordinators. Old free-text summaries may hold candid assessments of individuals, or
information shared under a past administration, that were never meant for wide re-reading. S1 also exposes the
full summary text by default, which is the most confidential field. Required: show summary text in a truncated
or expand-on-click form, and log access to the history view per user and country so a leak or misuse can be 
investigated. Without access logging, nobody can tell who read a country's history after an incident. |
| C3 | A5 | REVISED | 1 | `ACCEPTED` | S5 displays each Engagement's linked Contact's current name and role, 
